stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> SourcePublished
  SourcePublished --> StageCloned : clone/rebind verified
  StageCloned --> QuarantineReady : restore + migrations + OCR
  QuarantineReady --> ActivationReady : control evidence prepared
  ActivationReady --> Active : signed atomic pointer
  Active --> BackedUp : first stage_2026 receipt
  BackedUp --> RoundTripVerified : isolated restore passes
  RoundTripVerified --> PrivateStage : public gate not approved
  RoundTripVerified --> PublicExceptionReview
  PublicExceptionReview --> Public : owner approval + controls
  SourcePublished --> [*] : mutation or digest failure
  StageCloned --> [*] : collision or incomplete set
  QuarantineReady --> PrivateStage : activation not scheduled
